From f5b64f42dae6cf5f3c9604c4055d7a00980d25b4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 02:04:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(chat): system_mode=replace in /chat; editable chat
 system prompt in the panel
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

inference:
- POST /chat: new field/query param system_mode = append (default) | replace.
  replace skips the server's base persona prompt and uses only 'system'
  (empty 'system' -> 400; unknown mode -> 400). Works for JSON, multipart and query.

vision_app:
- chat_prompt.py: chat system prompt stored in DB (settings), default text in code;
  compose_system_prompt() puts it before the tool prompt, which is left untouched
- chat_with_model(system_mode=...), run_chat_turn sends system_mode=replace
- /panel/categories/ renamed 'Промпты': chat prompt card above the categories table
  (save / reset, length limit CHAT_PROMPT_MAX_CHARS editable in /panel/settings/)
- README, locales, index page docs
